<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 105,100.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 105,100.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.11 vs   1.91</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.51 vs   3.18 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.46 vs   3.07</p>
<p> Sales		   26.27 vs  19.02</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.93 vs  25.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.08 vs  39.95</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.25 vs  32.95</p>
<p> Sales		  224.24 vs 172.06</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewery is Zaklady Piwowarskie w</p>
<p>Zywcu Zywiec SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
